    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@value": "WGPG_TOOL abbreviations could be the name of the test reference. Examples of WGPG_CODE include: SGR Spectral Gamma, CAL3 3 arm calliper.\nGood practice dictates that Instrument method, upper reading detection limits are provided as part of the appendix of the test.\nWGPG_CDIA is intentionally a text field recording the information provided to the wireline surveyors from the drilling operations to compare it to the information reported in CDIA (Casing Diameter by Depth) group.\nWGPG_STRT shall report the test top depth and WGPG_STOP shall report the base depth, irrespective of direction the test was run.\nEquipment data sheets shall be added in FILE_FSET.",
        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
